      "category": "IMPLICIT_TRANSITION",
      "subject": "server",
      "stage": "sip_fsm",
      "description": "A stateless proxy MUST validate a request as described in Section 16.3 and MUST follow the request processing steps described in Sections 16.4 through 16.5; the request is sent directly to the transport layer instead of through a client transaction.",
