      "subject": "server",
      "stage": "sip_fsm",
      "description": "When a response arrives at a stateless proxy, the proxy MUST inspect the sent-by value in the first (topmost) Via header field value. If that address matches the proxy, the proxy MUST remove that header field value from the response and forward the result to the location indicated in the next Via header field value.",
